    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Flynn Estate Agents are delighted to bring The Court to the rental market. A charming 2 bedroom duplex located in the quiet, mature and leafy development off Watermill Road.The location cannot be underestimated, located off Watermill Road with numerous amenities on your doorstep; Raheny Village with its choice of shops, restaurants, coffee shops are only minutes walk from the house. The No. 6 bus route stops outside the development on Watermill Road and the DART station at Raheny Village is a 15 minute walk from the house. A choice of DART and bus services also provide quick and convenient access to East Point Business Park, IFSC and the Dublin City Centre. For runners, walkers and general outdoor enthusiasts can enjoy the Promenade Cycle Track & Walkway together with all the activities available in St. Annes Park and a choice of sports clubs.\n\nAccommodation comprises of: Reception hall, lounge, kitchen, 2 bedrooms and a shower room."
